# Public API tests

- New or changed public HTTP behavior needs a package-level test in the package that owns that behavior.
- When `packages/axc-verification` already contains an acceptance package, that behavior also needs one acceptance scenario.
- Reuse the existing Serenity feature and step pattern. Do not add another test framework.
